00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.000
it would have to be classified at the very highest levels.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.000
Nobody's asking the government to release the details.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Just put our minds at ease that we're not crazy

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.000
when we see these things in the sky.

